---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Image from '../../components/OptimizedImage.astro';
import reflectionsImage from '../../../assets/reflections_1.jpg';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Small Town Feel, Big Time Service: A Community Spotlight on Reflections Paint & Body Works Shelby | Community Spotlight"
  description="A Community Spotlight on Reflections Paint & Body Works Shelby, NC — a family-owned auto body and collision repair shop on South Post Road known for quality work, a lifetime warranty, and over a decade of trusted service."
>
  <article class="pt-32 pb-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <header class="mb-16 text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 mb-6 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-orange-500/20 bg-orange-500/5">
          <span class="text-orange-500 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Community Spotlight</span>
          <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-orange-500/30"></span>
          <span class="text-brand-sky/60 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest">August 2026</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-heading text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black text-white mb-8 tracking-tight leading-[1.1]">
          Small Town Feel, Big Time Service: <br />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-cyan to-brand-blue">Spotlight on Reflections Paint &amp; Body Works Shelby</span>
        </h1>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none">
        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          When your vehicle needs body work, you're not just looking for someone to fix a dent — you're trusting someone with something you rely on every single day.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          That's why it matters so much who you hand the keys to.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Reflections Paint &amp; Body Works Shelby, located at 2314 South Post Road, has spent a decade building exactly that kind of trust throughout our community. Recently I had the chance to meet with the team and see firsthand why so many people across Cleveland County recommend them.
        </p>

        <div class="my-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl max-w-[640px] mx-auto">
          <Image src={reflectionsImage} alt="Reflections Paint & Body Works Shelby" class="w-full h-auto" />
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">A Decade of Keeping Shelby on the Road</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Reflections is a family owned and operated collision repair facility that has been in business since 2015. As of this past fall, the team celebrated ten full years of serving drivers in and around Shelby.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          What really stands out about their story is the experience behind it. The owners brought decades of hands-on experience — over 30 years as repair technicians — to the shop. They're on site daily and personally look over every repair that comes through the door. They use state-of-the-art equipment and only the best repair materials and paint, backing every job with a lifetime warranty on workmanship.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">First Impressions Matter</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          When I stopped by the South Post Road location, Will was the first person I met — and honestly, he's exactly the kind of person you want handling your repair. Super professional, courteous from the moment you walk in, and genuinely treats you like a neighbor rather than just another customer.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          He walked me through what they do, how the process works, and you can tell right away that communication and transparency aren't just buzzwords here — they're how the shop operates every day. That personal touch goes a long way, and it's clear why so many people in the area trust Reflections with their vehicles.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">More Than Just Paint</h2>
        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Reflections offers a full range of collision and body work services to get you safely back on the road:
        </p>

        <ul class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 list-none p-0 mb-12">
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Collision &amp; structural repair</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Paintless dent repair</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Glass &amp; windshield replacement</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Detailing</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Insurance assistance</span></li>
          <li class="bg-brand-dark/30 p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/5 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-orange-500">✦</span><span class="text-brand-sky/80">Free estimates &amp; towing</span></li>
        </ul>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          They work with all major insurance companies to help streamline the claims process, and every repair comes with a lifetime warranty on workmanship for as long as you own your vehicle.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Their mission says it all: to keep your car on the road.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mt-16 mb-8">Supporting Local Businesses Matters</h2>
        <p class="text-white mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          One of the things I enjoy most through Shelby Web Company is seeing local businesses succeed.
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Reflect on the story behind so many great local shops: it takes years of consistency, dedication, and earning the trust of your community. That's exactly what Reflections has built — and it shows in every interaction, from the front desk to the finished repair.
        </p>

        <p class="text-white mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Whether you need major collision repair, a simple dent removed, or just want a reliable body shop you can count on, give Reflections Paint &amp; Body Works Shelby a call. They'll take care of you — and they'll keep you informed the whole way.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-600 to-brand-darkest p-10 rounded-[2rem] text-center relative overflow-hidden my-12">
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_50%,rgba(255,165,0,0.1),transparent_70%)]"></div>
          <p class="text-white text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium relative z-10">
            Congratulations to the whole Reflections team on ten years of keeping Shelby on the road — and a big thank you to Will for the incredible hospitality. Here's to many more.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Interested in learning more about Reflections Paint &amp; Body Works Shelby?
        </p>

        <p class="text-brand-sky/80 mb-12 leading-relaxed">
          Visit their website to explore their services, request an estimate, or get directions to the South Post Road shop:
        </p>

        <p class="mb-12">
          <a href="https://www.reflectionspaint-shelby.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline decoration-brand-cyan/30 underline-offset-4">https://www.reflectionspaint-shelby.com/</a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 p-8 bg-brand-dark/50 border border-white/5 rounded-2xl">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">More Community Spotlights</h2>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-brand-sky/70">
          <p>Read more about the people and businesses keeping our region strong: <a href="/blog/newtons-karate-jimmy-newton-spotlight/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">Jimmy Newton and Newton's Karate</a>, <a href="/blog/daniel-thomas-mayor-boiling-springs-spotlight/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">Mayor Daniel Thomas of Boiling Springs</a>, and <a href="/blog/fs-expedited-llc-spotlight/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">F&amp;S Expedited LLC</a>.</p>
          <p class="mt-4">Love seeing local businesses thrive? We spotlight Cleveland County companies through our <a href="/services/web-design/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">web design</a> and <a href="/services/seo/" class="text-brand-cyan hover:underline">local SEO</a> services.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <footer class="mt-24 pt-12 border-t border-white/5 flex flex-wrap gap-8 items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/blog/" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-2">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
          Back to Blog
        </a>
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <a href="/" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
          <a href="/about/" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors">About Us</a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-sky/60 hover:text-white transition-colors">Contact</a>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>